From e5bd022e058fe3717cacb4b014b88abbc87eb921 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kreijstal <elektrischrainbow@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 20:37:36 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Run on Windows

- Wait for the per-file child processes through a GLib child watch; there
  is no waitpid() or setsid() on Windows.
- Load plugins with the .dll suffix and split plugin and configuration
  search paths at G_SEARCHPATH_SEPARATOR instead of ':', which is part of
  every drive letter path.
- Plugins cannot leave the plugin API undefined for zathura.exe to provide
  at load time, so the pkg-config file links them against the import
  library of the executable.
- Windows installations can be moved: resolve the plugin, locale and
  system configuration directories relative to the executable.
---
 meson.build              |  4 ++++
 zathura/config.c         |  6 ++++--
 zathura/dbus-interface.c |  2 +-
 zathura/main.c           | 34 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 zathura/plugin.c         | 11 +++++++++--
 zathura/utils.c          | 14 ++++++++++++++
 zathura/utils.h          | 11 +++++++++++
 7 files changed, 76 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

